# Earthbend's return is a delayed triggered ability (CR 701.66a, 603.7), no ability of the land: an effect that makes the
# land lose its abilities doesn't stop it (CR 603.7c). Bot1's Badgermole Cub earthbends its Forest (a 1/1 land creature);
# Bot2's Turn to Frog makes it a 1/1 Frog with no abilities (2 power with its +1/+1 counter), then Bolts it. The Forest
# returns to the battlefield tapped under Bot1's control.

